Router: fix the routing API data race at the pin

FORK DEVIATION: a minimal fix, not upstream code. Upstream fixes the same race with a larger
refactor that does not apply to the pin. pickRouteInternal reads a snapshot of the rules taken
under a read lock, ReloadRules clips the rule slice so appends never write into a published
snapshot, and balancer lookups take the same lock.

